    - Field_3 requires 2 more drones, thus we will need to pull in enough resources from other idle drones.
    - Other fields mentioned (like Field_4) will also require attention, as they need additional drones.

5. **Assess Remaining Drones**: After the main allocations for high-priority fields, any remaining drones will be allocated to moderate priority fields which are undersupplied based on their respective needs.

